block head
    title Vomiting - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Vomiting
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/symptoms/8106-nausea--vomiting") Cleveland Clinic]:
    blockquote Nausea and vomiting are symptoms of many different health conditions, including early pregnancy, concussions and the stomach flu. Happening in both adults and children, there are many ways to relieve nausea. Drinking ice-cold beverages and eating light, bland foods can help.
